<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Vasp Q1 net 31.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Vasp Q1 net 31.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian airline Vasp sent the following statement to the Sao Paulo stock exchange on its first quarter results.</p>
<p>		     Q1 1997		 Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	31.313 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Net revs	 361.540 million	   N/A</p>
<p>Net worth	 83.816 million	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. No comparative data were available.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
